ll implement</b> a new database in the company."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You need to know we build software that will help your company by meeting all the requirements."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It will display all the data in tables, and you can easily access to it."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What Is a Database?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Databases organize the digital data a company or an individual may have."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A database is usually the way people and companies collect and record their data into computers or servers.<br/><br/>  Depending on the nature of the company, there are many kinds of databases, each of them have a specific purpose, there are databases which functions are to merely organize data or to keep track of the number of goods left in the inventory.<br/><br/>In the following chart, you will see some of the most common databases."}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob05img01.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plug in "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an extension program/app for specific software"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm looking for a software to keep control of the accountant and logistic areas of my company through the web, something like a plug-in for my web page."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in stock "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "available "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Most of the data we have got to work with is the one that we generate from our customers as well as the goods we have or not in stock."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "key fields "}, {"type": 