es about database types "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice my pronunciation with them "}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n5le01ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n5le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<b>Helen:</b> Good evening sir and welcome to IT solutions, what can I do for you today? <br><b>Josh:</b> Hi Helen, I'm looking for a software to keep control of the accountant and logistic areas of my company through the web, something like a plugin for my web page. <br><b>Helen:</b> Well, you've come to the right place. Tell me, what is your company about? <br><b>Josh:</b> We're in charge of importing and exporting coffeemakers as well as supplies. <br><b>Helen:</b> Okay, I see. In that case, you need to know we build software that will help your company by meeting all the requirements. In other words, we are going to provide you with a database. <br>"}, {"time": "33000", "image": "enpe8n5le01ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<b>Josh:</b> A database? <br><b>Helen:</b> Yes, it's a tool that permits you to collect and organize all the information in different servers. <br><b>Josh:</b> So, are we going to have to pay more for that tool? <br><b>Helen:</b> No. you aren't. You just have got to tell me the kind of data you need to manage. <br><b>Josh:</b> Most of the data we have got to work with is the one that we generate from our customers as well as the goods we have or not in stock. <br>"}, {"time": "59000", "image": "enpe8n5le01ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<b>Helen:</b> If that's the case, we can offer you the relational database, which is the most common one. It will display all the data in tables, and you can easily access to it as all the information is linked by key fields. <br><b>Josh:</b> Now, you mention it, we've been using that tool for years, and our company has grown a little bit. <br><b>Helen:</b> So, we have other types of databases. For instance, the operational database which is specially designed to keep track of products you have left in the inventory and information alike. Then, the distributed database which is used to share the data among branches. <br><b>Josh:</b> I think I'll acquire the second one. I'm not going to have to use the third one yet."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n5le01ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can describe what a database is."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about different types of databases."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about relational databases."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Is it easier to have your information on paper or digital? Why?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What do you think the pros of collecting your information in a computer are?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "I need to file this information."}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, 